{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/108732-changeling-questions-and-curiosities","id":108732,"title":"Changeling Questions and Curiosities","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-08T16:15:57-07:00","id":108732,"title":"Changeling Questions and Curiosities","content":"So, I'm going over the Changeling books after years and years trying to get a friend of mine to RP Changeling again. In doing so I keep coming across details that pique my curiosity, but never got more detail in the books, but were probably asked way back in the day when Changeling was still new on White-Wolf's forums. I figured I'd ask some questions here. Firstly, regarding chimera spawning from dreams, what happens when a fae sleeps? Do they dream? Or is that completely redundant? They can create their own chimera, but their Mortal selves have to sleep sometime too. As they dream (if they dream), are they somehow also in The Dreaming? Or can they go places they are dreaming of? Say you are in the states and dream of London. Are you in The Dreaming of London? Or just a pocket realm that looks like London? I realize that when one is dealing with the Dreamworld, the laws of Reality and Physics go flying out the window giggling all the way, but the guidelines in the books are full of holes and I'm trying to patch them as best I can. <br /> <br /> My second question is about Fae steeds. It hints at other animals having faerie souls like Changelings, but seems to limit itself to dogs and horses. I had the idea of a Fae cat, but it was suggested I should use Familiar rules instead of Changeling for Charms and powers. Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-09T01:57:28-07:00","id":109103,"title":"","content":"Changelings do in fact dream.<br /> Changeling dreams have been known to create chimera, and even their nightmares. They tend to be very potent given their direct connection to The Dreaming itself. It is a storytelling tool however, there are no solid mechanics for it. Other than of course the Chimera Background. When Changeling Dream they are not fully in the Dreaming, only their subconcious, as is the case with mortals. A Changeling with high levels of Dreamcraft and Oniermancy maybe able to pull off such &quot;dreamtravel&quot; but it would dangerous and risk bedlam if someone attempted it in a game I was running.<br /> <br /> Fae steeds I always saw as either Chimerical Companions or Kinian. There is a full set of rules involving creations points, and Redes (like Charms but for Chimerical creatures). If you want it to be a physical being with Fae Blood, I would use a modified version of the Kinian rules detailed in The Enchanted Book. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>May you live in interesting times...</i><br /> <br /> Storyteller of <b><a href=\"https://sunforgedoath.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sun Forged Oath</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}